From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Factory AI Bot <factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Mar 2026 23:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix STIG playbook for Ansible 2.20 and audit 4.x compat

1) Ansible 2.20 enforces strict boolean conditionals. Using
   regex_search() directly in a when: clause returns None when there
   is no match, which is rejected as a non-boolean value. Replace
   with 'is search()' test which returns proper True/False.

2) Remove /usr/sbin/autrace from the audit tools permission list.
   autrace was removed in audit 4.x and no longer ships in the
   audit package, causing the task to fail with 'file is absent'.

Signed-off-by: Factory AI Bot <factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 tasks/photon.yml | 5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tasks/photon.yml b/tasks/photon.yml
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/tasks/photon.yml
+++ b/tasks/photon.yml
@@ -628,14 +628,14 @@
       register: output
       changed_when: output.rc == 0
       when:
-        - telnetinstalled.stdout | regex_search("netkit-telnet-0")
+        - telnetinstalled.stdout is search("netkit-telnet-0")
 
     - name: PHTN-50-000040 - Remove telnet server
       ansible.builtin.command: tdnf -y remove netkit-telnet-server
       register: output
       changed_when: output.rc == 0
       when:
-        - telnetinstalled.stdout | regex_search("netkit-telnet-server")
+        - telnetinstalled.stdout is search("netkit-telnet-server")
 
 ###################################################################################################################################
 - name: PHTN-50-000041 - Configure login.defs PASS_MIN_DAYS
@@ -915,7 +915,6 @@
         - {file: '/usr/sbin/auditd'}
         - {file: '/usr/sbin/aureport'}
         - {file: '/usr/sbin/ausearch'}
-        - {file: '/usr/sbin/autrace'}
       when:
         - auditdinstalled.stdout != ""
 
